# Global property for command line builds (dotnet build/restore, msbuild).
# NuGet restore ignores AdditionalProperties of ProjectReferences, so the referenced
# projects (EdiabasLib, PsdzRpcClientLibrary) would be restored without the Android target.
-p:EnableAndroidTargets=true
# The implicit restore of dotnet build does not use the -p properties of this file.
-restoreProperty:EnableAndroidTargets=true
